          "content": {
            "size": 3881,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 3212,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"A whitespace-only line indented code keeps is the code's, not a blank line, so it spaces no list or item.\\n\\n\\u003e - ```\\n\\u003e   code\\n\\u003e   \\n\\u003e   note\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\nAfter.\\n\\n- a\\n\\n  ```\\n      x\\n    \\n  ```\\n- b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n1. a\\n\\n   ```\\n      x\\n      \\n   ```\\n2. b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n\\u003e - a\\n\\u003e\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e   code\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e - b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n\\u003e - ```\\n\\u003e     x\\n\\u003e     \\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e   b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n- ```\\n  code\\n  more\\n    \\n  \\n  \\n      \\n  ```\\n- b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n- a\\n  - b\\n\\n    ```\\n    code\\n    ```\\n  - c\\n\\nEnd.\\n\",\"markdown_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A whitespace-only line indented code keeps is the code's, not a blank line, so it spaces no list or item.\"}]},{\"type\":\"blockquote\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"attrs\":{\"spread\":false},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"code_block\",\"attrs\":{\"language\":null},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"code\\n\\nnote\"}]}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After.\"}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"attrs\":{\"spread\":true},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"a\"}]},{\"type\":\"code_block\",\"attrs\":{\"language\":null},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"    x\\n  \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"attrs\":{\"spread\":false},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"b\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Next.\"}]},{\"type\":\"ordered_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"attrs\":{\"spread\":true},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"a